{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "b34ce936495b2fe67e02de513c9e177565b689f2d5280d234a9dad64648fceb8", "ja": "リリィ・クエスト ～天空の子豚～ 伝説へ", "zh": "莉莉任务 ～天空小猪～ 走向传说", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a2f871e65ef85211faa39daca161f837b70b8fa037f032cdda51e33751ed578d", "ja": "百合子を止めたのは、亜利沙だった。朋花は\n悪い魔王じゃないと説明され、真実を知った\n百合子は、朋花と和解。世界には平和が訪れ\nた……。応援上映が終わり、百合子達は気合\nいを入れて舞台挨拶へと向かうのだった。", "zh": "阻止百合子的，是亚利沙。朋花被解释为并不是坏魔王，得知真相的百合子与朋花和解。世界迎来了和平……应援放映结束后，百合子一行人打起精神，前往舞台致辞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "546fdb9897267a05af4d7297cbd870e6c7128e32fa0464dfe97993fb11bcead7", "ja": "あなたはあまりにも多くの民をしいたげた。\n覚悟はいいですか？", "zh": "你残害了太多的人民。\n做好觉悟了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "b82100ce0eb2d3a46bd4094191b4145c6016cb4ca4f40744e56f758bd5f04f20", "ja": "待ってください！\n朋花さまは悪い魔王さまじゃありませんよ～っ！", "zh": "请等一下！\n朋花大人不是坏魔王啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "93a561edf0b9382dd8d274a5c84f2a21772fa0d97d098ce0fa0d3d96e8491ff0", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達をとっても愛していて、いろんな技術で\nみんなの生活を豊かにしようとしてくれているんです！", "zh": "她非常深爱着小猪仔们，还用各种各样的技术\n努力让大家的生活变得更丰富多彩呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "9b10f8f10eda6914c842dae1b35afd485bb7de4889ddc09443df43300c1dd390", "ja": "これを見てください、\n朋花さまと子豚ちゃん達が築いたこの国の姿です！", "zh": "请看看这个——\n这是朋花大人和小猪猪们共同建设的国家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1005_kobutachan", "source_sha256": "f92b09ec40ed1dea682a18dae44227a1adc05b22c7b6ec319075a0b09d040fed", "ja": "ぶっひ、ぶっひ！", "zh": "噗哧，噗哧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "5a983eb644b228c8670f33cb5465685e441d8e5110013739b46412798b420ce1", "ja": "えっほ、えっほ。\nロコも一緒にワーキングです！", "zh": "吭哧，吭哧。\n也和ROCO一起工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "d189d6ab1396d30751d6fd88595d9f3f5cee140f7d3d795f8ff26957fe63d0d6", "ja": "こ、これは……！", "zh": "这、这是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "af1ab3aac22e2c0e89be3855581a838690516bdb32707bee721839aa9210ed40", "ja": "ここにいる子豚ちゃん達はみんな、\n私と思いを一つにし、私への忠誠を誓い。", "zh": "在这里的小猪们，全都与我的心意合而为一，向我宣誓效忠。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "cbc2015f4bdab6489433848ab767108d909b28a545eda1cc0c877c599c976235", "ja": "日夜努力して、\n自ら進んで文明化をすすめてくれているんですよ～♪", "zh": "他们不分昼夜地努力着，主动推动文明发展哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "8b1be7af611975e7004c78ee8cef18a24eaec8fcc41d5cd5797d8150bff7f31a", "ja": "魔王領には本もいっぱいあるんです、ほら。\nお城の書庫を見てください！", "zh": "魔王领里也有很多书哦，您看。\n请看看城堡的藏书室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "324f8c5a51d11360112639c7e005ebc351583f6fd1c1e60560bffd4e1cc69a47", "ja": "うわぁ！　本がいっぱい……！", "zh": "哇啊！好多书……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "64b035fbbd9ea57d16aea1bd33256714f8746bc310267b417aa993d647c27de2", "ja": "あ、これ私の読んでいた『アデライトと七つの世界』！\nやっぱり下巻が出てたんだ！", "zh": "啊，这是我正在读的《阿黛莱特与七个世界》！\n果然出下卷了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1013_se", "source_sha256": "7908229f69b9efd12c38693cfd2e1b1bf705f55085250bb6630062118c2c5e0a", "ja": "ペラッ", "zh": "（翻阅）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "f0a69da74f060fdfe411a79ffc8bd1a739c3d24d1aea05567f1f1a842e4a6274", "ja": "え？　これは……！\n……そっか。ふふ、そういうこと……。", "zh": "诶？这是……！\n……原来如此。呵呵，是这么回事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1015_se", "source_sha256": "ec1af790cbe5a717d390a701e0d39fdb8669efd3b376f0195d6a366da2749d27", "ja": "パタン……", "zh": "磅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "0330ec8e89eef14d7668839b2a00504df9f76c100cac1870fec82c139cf19790", "ja": "どうしたんですか～？", "zh": "怎么了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "f1da71be867cf443b57d29f19ee0d95dbfea32e4e304411dd5afd828c30908ea", "ja": "魔王……いいえ朋花さん。あなたにお願いがあります！\n私はあなたの国の技術を、世界中のみんなに広めたい！", "zh": "魔王……不，是朋花小姐。我有件事想拜托您！我想把您国家的技术推广给全世界的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "19d00cdc5d5ae4028c4a846559ca81af6f8118c0c0ed8b6bf69a4793fe7efdf5", "ja": "もっとたくさんの人に本を読んでもらいたい。\n身も心も豊かになってもらいたいんです！", "zh": "我想让更多的人能读到书。\n想让大家的身心都能变得更加丰富充实！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "1f5aa064d98a658b043b509b08dfc6b5120ca7d843200f68291086f76459b5b6", "ja": "百合子さん……。", "zh": "百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "a1da6d5f66c7583b3ca0b7f11e79207b2533324457a683b6951c147459d1d245", "ja": "わかりました～。\n子豚ちゃん達も、その方が喜ぶでしょうから。", "zh": "我知道了～\n因为那样的话，小猪们也一定会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "3757341d1e7111d78cf58f768589735424042cd0fd5a4f89a92ae843935bf85c", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nこれでみんなの暮らしもぐっと便利になります！", "zh": "太感谢了！\n这样一来，大家的生活也会变得更加便利了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "e917c1aa9934e85519ec5a749e579c9fbbda753e198ee565bab00176a1f38afd", "ja": "待ってください。子豚ちゃんたちの顔を見てください。\nみんな目の下にくまを浮かべて、働き続けています！", "zh": "请等一下。请看看小猪们的脸。\n大家都顶着黑眼圈，一直在工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1023_kobutachan", "source_sha256": "8fc182d3c7e60d64ba009dd27bf76cb5a08faf40e319fa38e461a7235d2ed023", "ja": "ぶひぃ……ぶひぃ……。", "zh": "哼哧……哼哧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "004ca421e020aaca28b1cf2be4cd9c7cfaa7f0424e71c4a3849eeab2ba9d35a2", "ja": "ううっ、ロコもタイヤードですけど……\nファ、ファイトです！　えっほ……えっほ……。", "zh": "呜呜，ROCO也很疲惫（Tired），不过……\n加、加油！嗬哧……嗬哧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "155cea597bb44f1354388bc3cbab66ccd06aa2cfd85caf0fd6e5bfac00a9e42f", "ja": "パパが言ってました。こういう働き方は、\nぶらっく企業でよくないんだって！", "zh": "爸爸说过，这种工作方式在黑心企业里很常见，是不行的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "3a3250f0c4bf60b18be38d95883b69192fa42a5d46d40dbf61f32e8f0cba561f", "ja": "たとえ本人が望んでいても、働いてばかりでは\n本当に幸せにはなれないと思います！", "zh": "即使是本人希望这样，我觉得总是埋头工作也不会真正幸福！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "28301eb113c7222c5584bbfbe7750f487733dbf047a29934f337e433beb07a6e", "ja": "そうですね～……。それでは勇者と魔王の和解記念\nということで、休日を制定しましょう。", "zh": "是啊～……那么，就以勇者和魔王和解为纪念，设立一个休息日吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "ae87c06e006b4f85dbdc8636fdb499c004f04e585008c234dd7382e624249ffd", "ja": "これは命令です～！\nみんな、きちんと休まないとおしおきですよ～？", "zh": "这是命令哦～！\n大家要是不好好休息，可是要受到惩罚的哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1029_kobutachan", "source_sha256": "4b611f8dd084fb42a93f09b4addc47887870c9126680479ec2b113cdc0f488ea", "ja": "ぶひぶひぶひ～！", "zh": "哼哼哼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "7e24f57b2198f50f8adf893d1c47a6678d6aaafed7a91e996391e31f04aabde1", "ja": "サンクスです、トモカ！\nみんな、よかったですね！　ホリデーですよ！", "zh": "谢谢啦，朋花！\n太好了，大家！是假期哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "22ffe4fc954b83eec9839a545900384b6a07b69d3699afe9783b00b04748256c", "ja": "朋花さん、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "朋花，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "84310240000fef1d0f9f76cb04c710ee503565b9f673cb7094a5184463d112e1", "ja": "ムフフ♪\n休日は踊り子ちゃんのライブに行きたいです♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪\n休息日我想去看舞者们的演出♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "0ce3e2954371affc6d554d06549a91a4df7d8f7e4e85e233b0d45fe15d807ca8", "ja": "百合子さんは、まずは『アデライトと七つの世界』の\n下巻を読むんですよね？", "zh": "百合子，首先要读《阿德莱特与七个世界》的下卷，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "5081d9df7f233d3210318a8984cc21cbf1eece44145ec51695c7f045d9768cdc", "ja": "あ……、それなら、もう読み終わっちゃった。\nあの下巻は、最初のページしか書かれていなかったの。", "zh": "啊……那本的话，我已经读完了。\n因为那本下卷只有第一页写了内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "d6b83e8ecab7f089325a813ab3147b2831dfe9a1d14fa5c656b12becdf3c2488", "ja": "あとは全部白紙のページ……。\n『この本を手に取りし勇者よ……』", "zh": "剩下的全是空白页……\n“拿起这本书的勇者啊……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "f455a7c47696cede5df51dc3def90ae09fc03256927286d21ac73a750471ce82", "ja": "『アデライトを光で満たす役目を汝に託そう。\nその冒険の物語により、この書は完結する……』", "zh": "『将让阿德莱特充满光明的使命托付于汝。\n这场冒险的故事，将使此书迎来完结……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "3ec6315fe2ddd24821bef84106e913eca7b8b3e19a68b0d575aa0b3720748d3b", "ja": "……だって♪", "zh": "……书上是这么说的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1038_026yur", "source_sha256": "44328b354fe030d9418c3bcb638706d0ca2ea750dee638daffabe7b9a83aeb3e", "ja": "こうして、昼夜もなく働いていた子豚さん達は、\n週休二日の健康的な生活を取り戻しました。", "zh": "就这样，不分昼夜工作的那些小猪们，恢复了每周双休的健康生活。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1039_026yur", "source_sha256": "191e0546658a87647b4169274f503078cf077ddcc1edd48dd33312a9bbf53283", "ja": "勇者と魔王は和解し、\n以後、互いに国の発展のために尽くしたといいます。", "zh": "据说，勇者和魔王和解了，此后双方都为各自国家的发展竭尽了全力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1040_026yur", "source_sha256": "24977c528540cf20334c0bc1b2a1ac30706d9cec23fb26dfc99154f4c0041724", "ja": "かくして、ミリオネージュ大陸には\n再び平和が訪れたのでした。……めでたしめでたし。", "zh": "就这样，百万富翁大陆再次迎来了和平。……可喜可贺，可喜可贺。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1042_p", "source_sha256": "4b70e56bbab5bd9b0b233b04c6d52c70b1a282ea74b8ed395f77bda13f5c63ac", "ja": "（応援上映は大盛況で終わった。お客さんの応援は、\n会場中に響いてたな……。この後は、舞台挨拶だ！）", "zh": "（应援观影会圆满结束了。观众们的加油声响彻整个会场呢……接下来是舞台问候！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1043_028ari", "source_sha256": "1213409395ca09c342539abebd85cabbe9a767e488d47778067b681ad5b76b1d", "ja": "何回もリピートした作品ですけど、大画面で見ると、\nまた違った味わいがあります。はあ～……最高。", "zh": "这部作品我已经反复看过好多次了，不过在大银幕上观看，又有另一番滋味。哈啊～……太棒了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1044_025roc", "source_sha256": "34ec8c7f0ac0b4013b3494cb0dbaa5a84983d85a2c00f91064859db556043b17", "ja": "ムービーが終わってから、ずっとこうなんです！\nもう～。リアルにカムバックですよ、アリサ！", "zh": "电影结束后，她就一直这样了！\n真是的——阿利沙，快回到现实来啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1045_026yur", "source_sha256": "85fbd64b2ab48f21fab6facefa65a0637efb64e8906be0ac3419f1c2839d95ea", "ja": "でも亜利沙さんの気持ちもわかります。\nスクリーンでみると没入感が圧倒的に違いますから。", "zh": "不过，我也能理解亚利沙小姐的心情。\n在大屏幕上观看时，沉浸感完全不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1046_022ser", "source_sha256": "99a0fe248615708a665119e26be6ee22e8a06ca079009b2c0bc8304dbf4114b6", "ja": "わたしもいっぱい勇者さんを応援しちゃいました！\nあの、朋花さん。応援できなくて、ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "我也给勇者先生加了好多油呢！\n那个，朋花小姐。没能给您加油，对不起……】【。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1047_031tom", "source_sha256": "7fcf20d2122f9dd62c58be5b358a0ce074a3af216953b393169c0566a80edad6", "ja": "あら。謝らなくていいんですよ～。夢中になれたのも、\nみんなが良い演技をしていたということですから。", "zh": "哎呀，不用道歉哦～。能让你如此投入，也说明大家的演技都很棒嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1048_p", "source_sha256": "525def46b2e2b1e2dab1c9fede3e2ad62742a1446a55afd579d62d1471483519", "ja": "それに、お客さん達はちゃんと、みんなのことを\n応援してくれてたから。大丈夫だよ、星梨花。", "zh": "而且，观众们也一直在为大家加油。所以没关系，星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1049_026yur", "source_sha256": "1d7f82b1decc310dbebeab0f239e0920bfd95a6a5713309837b1aba564b72bfa", "ja": "そうですね、朋花さんのことも亜利沙さんのことも。\nそれに、星梨花ちゃんのこともね！", "zh": "是啊，朋花和亚利沙也是。\n还有星梨花也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1050_022ser", "source_sha256": "1c561f2ac8dad2633e98b003db486dc5578c7fb4e2c9e5630ddb1455372781a4", "ja": "はい！　この後の舞台挨拶も、\nいっぱい頑張れそうです！　えへへ♪", "zh": "是的！接下来的舞台致辞，我也有信心努力表现了！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1051_025roc", "source_sha256": "8b2ddd6be9ffaa11a40246a27bdb852e27544525a09d78c9375148b0da211e80", "ja": "ア～リ～サ～！　……ううっ。\n{$P$}、ヘルプです～！", "zh": "亚——利——沙——！……呜呜。\n{$P$}先生，救命啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1052_p", "source_sha256": "e344506d38c2886990ba5a7ea2bbdeb839f45f90f9b2dc527bcefbe4828affdc", "ja": "まったく……舞台挨拶ももうすぐだっていうのに。\nわかったよ、ロコ。俺が……。", "zh": "真是的……明明马上就要进行舞台问候了。\n我知道了，ROCO。我来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1053_031tom", "source_sha256": "f1cbb9e305e05a5f4569f3bf79729147262e7e1e690a98edefa315f3f26cd222", "ja": "待ってください、{$P$}さん～。\nここは、私に任せてください～。", "zh": "请等一下，{$P$}先生～\n这里就交给我吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1054_031tom", "source_sha256": "bdf123a9d6e5d2ae15bce55e19a5d5c64076c5d321d41b1b8f90ab88cc235b40", "ja": "亜利沙さん、いつまでそうしているつもりですか～？\nもし、この後の挨拶で失敗したら……うふっ♪", "zh": "亚利沙小姐，你打算一直这样下去吗～？\n要是待会儿的致辞搞砸了……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1055_028ari", "source_sha256": "441cfce04fc650dc8c5bbb62eda13d8f3c0542ff21a81e264e23d3e0f279fb50", "ja": "ヒィィ！　こ、この強い気配は……！\nもも申し訳ありません、魔王さま～！！", "zh": "呜呜呜！这、这股强大的气息是……！\n非、非常抱歉，魔王大人～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1056_p", "source_sha256": "322133f202034deec603ccfa19db0d09d9f1d3b675c018aea48da2d9c52ef387", "ja": "はあ～。ありがとう、朋花。\nん？　そろそろ出番だな。", "zh": "哈啊～谢谢你，朋花。\n嗯？差不多该上场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1057_026yur", "source_sha256": "e8e88d30ed4330a9900150cf952323dde417969f23652119597b124d18ef2208", "ja": "はい！　今日は、この5人が勇者のパーティです！\n冒険の目的は、お客さんを楽しませること。", "zh": "没错！今天，这5人就是勇者小队！\n冒险的目的，是让客人们开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1058_026yur", "source_sha256": "0034a03c932b4d3f55dcbaadf10f3868731a07f79ee0a82a6d773ef53151453c", "ja": "さあ！　みんなで、新たな冒険をはじめましょう！", "zh": "那么！大家一起开始新的冒险吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1059_p", "source_sha256": "929d745151737028fe6ac484c0efb21ed75c9f76b1a1471b23a5dd27e4373c59", "ja": "（ファンの思いは応援として、アイドルの力になる。\nアイドルの思いも、様々な活動を通してファンに届く）", "zh": "（粉丝们的心意会化作支持，成为偶像的力量。偶像的心意也会通过各种活动传达给粉丝。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0179_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_07_1060_p", "source_sha256": "3b124acced3016e087e695c516534656ba1e5009f390ee41274a8e1d4e352b08", "ja": "（これからも、良い循環が続くように、\n新たな冒険……じゃなくて、仕事を頑張っていこう！）", "zh": "（为了让今后也能持续这样的良性循环，\n要努力做好新的冒险……不对，是工作！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
